Scripts that build, serve, check and quantize an EXL3 quant of reflection/Beam-1.0-501B-A23B on two NVIDIA DGX Spark (GB10)
nodes, ported from Diffbot's Beam EXL3 recipe (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Diffbot).

- gb10/ and quantize/: MIT (LICENSE). gb10/build-image.sh, gb10/build-kernels.sh and gb10/serve-node.sh are ports of the
  recipe's docker/build.sh, kernels/build.sh and serve/serve.sh. Diffbot's copyright and permission notice is reproduced in
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and must stay with any copy of those files.
- gb10/exllamav3-5be8865-aarch64.patch changes ExLlamaV3 (MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Turboderp); its notice is reproduced in
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
- third_party/vllm-exl3/: Diffbot's Beam patch for vllm-exl3 (github.com/vcruz305/vllm-exl3), AGPL-3.0-only, copied
  unchanged with its LICENSE, NOTICE.vllm-exl3 and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.vllm-exl3.md. Keep those files with any copy. If you
  serve a modified version of the patched plugin over a network, AGPL-3.0 section 13 applies.
- tf/: MIT (LICENSE). It serves TensorFold (github.com/ashhart/TensorFold, Apache License 2.0, by ashhart and the
  TensorFold contributors) from our fork, branch beam-1.0-tp2 of github.com/bertholomus/TensorFold, which carries
  TensorFold's license and notices. No TensorFold code is in this repository.
- No model weights are in this repository. Beam-1.0-501B-A23B and Beam-1.0-501B-A23B-DFlash2 are (c) Reflection under the
  Apache License 2.0; our quant is published separately under the same license, with Reflection's LICENSE file.

